","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1070","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[73,82,66,58,80,88],"title":-1,"rank":"7","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1015802","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1070","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[73,82,66,58,80,88],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1015802","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1070","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[73,82,66,58,80,88],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13008","armor":"WP1015802","horse":"WP29001"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东莱渠帅。性刚烈悍猛，胆识逾男，年少便流落草莽，熟稔山野作战、近身搏杀。汉末大乱，州郡崩毁、流民遍野，郑萁与同乡姜芸相识相惜，二人结为异姓姐妹，于东莱山中聚众起事。郑萁以其过人的胆识与武勇，成为这支“贼徒”势力的领袖。后东平人刘桢曾梦到“蛇生四足”，术士周宣解梦称：“当杀女子而作贼者。”不久后，郑、姜义军即遭到朝廷讨伐。","tc":"東萊渠帥。性剛烈悍猛，膽識逾男，年少便流落草莽，熟稔山野作戰、近身搏殺。漢末大亂，州郡崩毀、流民遍野，鄭萁與同鄉姜蕓相識相惜，二人結為異姓姐妹，于東萊山中聚眾起事。鄭萁以其過人的膽識與武勇，成為這支“賊徒”勢力的領袖。后東平人劉楨曾夢到“蛇生四足”，術士周宣解夢稱：“當殺女子而作賊者。”不久后，鄭、姜義軍即遭到朝廷討伐。","en":"A rebel chieftain of Donglai. Fierce, resolute, and possessing courage that surpassed most men, she was cast into the wild greenwood in her youth, becoming adept in mountain warfare and close-quarters combat. In the chaos at the end of the Han dynasty, with commanderies collapsing and displaced refugees roaming the lands, Zheng Qi met and bonded with her fellow villager Jiang Yun. The two became sworn sisters and raised a rebellion in the mountains of Donglai. With her extraordinary daring and martial prowess, Zheng Qi became the leader of this ‘rebel’ faction. Later, Liu Zhen of Dongping dreamt of a ‘snake growing four feet’. The diviner Zhou Xuan interpreted the dream, saying: ‘A woman who turned bandit shall be slain.’ Shortly thereafter, the rebel army of Zheng and Jiang was subjugated by the imperial court.","jp":"東莱の渠帥。気性は剛烈にして獰猛、胆力は男子を凌ぎ、若くして草莽に身を落として山野での戦法や白兵戦に熟達した。漢末の大乱において州郡は崩壊し、流民が野に満ちる中、鄭萁は同郷の姜芸と意気投合して義姉妹の契りを結び、東莱の山中にて衆を集めて蜂起した。鄭萁はその人並み外れた胆力と武勇によって、この「賊徒」勢力の首領となった。後に東平の劉楨が「蛇に四足が生える」夢を見た際、術士の周宣は「女子にして賊をなす者を討伐することになる」と夢を占った。それから間もなく、鄭と姜の義勇兵は朝廷の討伐を受けることとなった。","kr":"동래의 거수. 성품이 강렬하고 사나우며 담력이 사내를 능가했다. 어려서부터 초야를 떠돌아 산야 전투와 육박전에 능통했다. 한나라 말기의 대란으로 주군이 무너지고 유민이 들끓자, 정기는 동향 사람인 강운과 서로를 깊이 아껴 의자매를 맺고 동래의 산중에서 무리를 모아 봉기했다. 정기는 남다른 담력과 무용으로 이 '적도' 세력의 영수가 되었다. 훗날 동평 사람 유정이 '뱀에 발이 넷 달린' 꿈을 꾸자, 술사 주선이 해몽하기를 '마땅히 도적이 된 여자를 죽이게 될 징조'라고 하였다. 얼마 지나지 않아 정기와 강운의 의군은 조정의 토벌을 받게 되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1051815","remark":"","surname":"郑","surnameTc":"鄭","surnameEn":"Zheng","surnameJp":"鄭","surnameKr":"정","surnameOther":"","name":"萁","nameTc":"萁","nameEn":"Qi","nameJp":"萁","nameKr":"기","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"郑萁","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"190","city":"CS1070","gender":"1","rule":"73","force":"82","wise":"66","politics":"58","charm":"80","will":"88","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"12","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"7","charmTalent":"10","willTalent":"12","weaponMaster":"42/82/47/44/41/48/40/44","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"S1000202","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"1000201","warSoulPoint":"6000","battleSoulPoint":"8000","debateSoulPoint":"4000","strategy":"","strategy2":"1006501","professions":"2/0/2/2/2/0/2/0/0/0/2/2/4/2/1/5/1/1/4/0/2/3/3/2","attribute2":"73/82/66/58/80/88","morality":"6","compatible":"14","loyalty":"0","rep